{"unit_id":"btsd321__dsh-oh-my-terminal#feature-1","repo":"btsd321/dsh-oh-my-terminal","commit":"d9d7075c5f543a2bb6fdfa850cc27f3d11348544","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-oh-my-terminal** 的功能「多会话终端」：终端面板可创建并保留多个独立 PTY 会话；用户从面板选择会话即可切换，每个会话通过 HTTP 创建并以 WebSocket 收发终端数据。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/routes.ts:356","src/index.ts:381"]}
{"unit_id":"btsd321__dsh-oh-my-terminal#feature-2","repo":"btsd321/dsh-oh-my-terminal","commit":"d9d7075c5f543a2bb6fdfa850cc27f3d11348544","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-oh-my-terminal** 的功能「拆分面板」：用户可在终端组中拆分出并排终端面板；每个面板各自连接一个终端实例，并同步适配可用尺寸。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.tsx:301","src/client/term-pane.tsx:63"]}
